            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Hi!\r\n\r\nSorry, no, this is by design. Surrounding highlighting is expected to be done on demand while highlighting textobject seems a bit excessive. And it usually adds visual noise in case user already wants what is going to be replaced/surrounded. So this original feature from [machakann/vim-sandwich](https://github.com/machakann/vim-sandwich) will not be supported.",
